### Smoke-test the API from VS Code (install the "REST Client" extension, click "Send Request")
@base = http://localhost:4000

### Health (public)
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Paper summary (public)
GET {{base}}/api/paper/summary

### Sign in (the cookie is kept for the requests below)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@example.com", "password": "PUT-YOUR-ADMIN-PASSWORD-HERE" }

### List experiments (needs sign-in above)
GET {{base}}/api/experiments?limit=5

### Detect: which trained models can score records?
GET {{base}}/api/models

### Detect: the input fields of model 1
GET {{base}}/api/models/1/schema

### Detect: score records (values may be numbers or strings; missing numeric fields use the training average)
POST {{base}}/api/detect
Content-Type: application/json

{ "modelId": 1, "records": [ { "duration": 0, "protocol_type": "tcp", "service": "http", "flag": "SF", "src_bytes": 232, "dst_bytes": 8153 } ] }

### Detect: your recent analyses (counts only)
GET {{base}}/api/detect/history
